You're human.

12
00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.420
The new transfer.

13
00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:24.420
Yes.

14
00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.520
It's my first day.

15
00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.160
I'm a bit lost.

16
00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.260
I'm Ivy, by the way.

17
00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.060
Cute.

18
00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.760
Name doesn't matter.

19
00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.160
